  "_note": "Shared signs, risk modifiers (spec 0.5) and the S0-S3 ladder for all clinical pathways. Patterns are case-insensitive regular expressions matched per clause, with negation handling ('saans ki dikkat nahi'). Labels are the plain words shown to users. Concern patterns are internal routing labels, never diagnoses. Review with clinical mentors.",
